    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You lived the life of a seafarer, the wind at your back and the deck rolling under your feet. You've sat on barstools in more ports than you can count, weathered fierce storms, and traded stories with people who live beneath the waves.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Dexterity, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.dEHBNkPhkGDClF5U]{Tavern Brawler}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Acrobatics and Perception</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulNavigators]{Navigator's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Dagger}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulNavigators]{Navigator's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 20 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
